# Stable checkout alias. The macOS app links here, never at Creem directly:
# a shipped binary cannot be corrected, this product already moved from
# Lemon Squeezy to Creem once, and the Creem store has been rejected once.
# Keeping the indirection means a provider swap or a closed store is a
# one-line fix here instead of a dead button in every copy already installed.
# 302 for the same reason as the download alias, plus the path hit is the
# only in-app conversion metric CF's free plan can give us.
/hotspot-guard/buy https://www.creem.io/payment/prod_4ShjWH61KJYiHl0vRYcRHO 302
# Stable download alias for directory listings (MacUpdate etc.).
# 302 on purpose: target moves every release; 301 would be cached forever.
/hotspot-guard/download /hotspot-guard/assets/HotspotGuard-Pro-1.2.0.zip 302
# 带版本号的更新清单路径（1.0.14+ 客户端）：200 rewrite 回同一份 appcast.json。
# 版本进 path 是为了在 CF free plan 边缘日志里拿到活跃机器的版本分布
# （free plan 没有完整 UA / query / referer，path 是唯一可用维度）。
# 200 而不是 302：302 会让同一次 check-in 在日志里变成两条请求。
# 扁平路径 /hotspot-guard/appcast.json 必须永远保留给 ≤1.0.13 客户端。
/hotspot-guard/appcast/* /hotspot-guard/appcast.json 200
